        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of serous retinal detachment on OCT plus characteristic leakage on fluorescein angiography",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily clinical supported by multimodal imaging; exclusion of other causes of serous retinal detachment is essential."
